  "description": "LibTopoART.Compatibility provides simplified access to the neural networks of LibTopoART using common data types. In particular, the data type decimal is replaced by more widely supported types such as double.\n\nThe classes TopoART_i64d and TopoART_i64du8 may wrap TopoART, TopoART-AM, TopoART-C, TopoART-R, Episodic TopoART, Hypersphere TopoART, and Hypersphere TopoART-C neural networks provided by LibTopoART. Their methods are designed in such a way that the data type int64 (aka long) is used as the main integer type and the data type double is used as the main floating-point type. Class TopoART_i64du8 enables the usage of uint8 (aka byte) data for training and inference while still using int64 and double for the other parameters. This makes TopoART_i64du8 particularly interesting for image data.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "LibTopoART.Compatibility",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-26T21:51:53.863Z",
