  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "In version 0.8.0, support for saving networks to and loading them from byte arrays has been added. In particular, the classes TopoART_i64d and TopoART_i64du8 provide the method ToByteArray as well as a constructor accepting a byte array. Furthermore, the new class Control enables adjusting the verbosity of LibTopoART. This version requires LibTopoART 1.1.0 or above.",
